add('eq-181','Racah spin coupling','refined','Ordinary SU(2); real Clebsch–Gordan coefficients in a complex-amplitude model','C=δ_(M,m1+m2) √(A B) Σ_k (−1)^k / [k! (j1+j2−J−k)! (j1−m1−k)! (j2+m2−k)! (J−j2+m1+k)! (J−j1−m2+k)!]\nA=(2J+1)(J+j1−j2)!(J−j1+j2)!(j1+j2−J)! / (j1+j2+J+1)!\nB=(J+M)!(J−M)!(j1−m1)!(j1+m1)!(j2−m2)!(j2+m2)!\nk_min=max(0,j2−J−m1,j1−J+m2); k_max=min(j1+j2−J,j1−m1,j2+m2)','The displayed sum and k bounds agree with the Condon–Shortley convention after imposing triangle, half-integer and magnetic selection rules. This is not factorial arithmetic modulo a prime. Implementation bounds j1,j2,J to 0..6.','Independent exact-rational finite-sum oracle and singlet/triplet, highest-weight, orthogonality checks. Full displayed LaTeX is retained in parsed evidence.','math.cg 0.5 0.5 0.5 -0.5 0 0',['cg','cgphase'],['181']);
